?? "[DML-BEGIN]"
ON ERROR ? "ABBR-ERROR", ERROR()
SET HEADING OFF
SET SAFETY OFF
USE BASE ALIAS FIRST
DISPLAY OFF NAME RECORD 1
REPLACE NAME WITH "TEST" RECORD 1 WHILE .T.
APPEND BLANK
REPLACE NAME WITH "TAIL", BAL WITH 1500
GO TOP
LOCATE FOR BAL>1000 WHILE .T.
? RECNO(), FOUND()
SELECT 2
STORE 2 TO AREAFLAG
SELECT FIRST
INDEX ON NAME TO NAMES
STORE 5 TO STORED
STORE 6 TO STORENO
STORE "WITH WHILE RECORD DISPLAY" TO STORNAME
? STORED, STORENO, STORNAME, AREAFLAG
SAVE TO VALUES
STORED=99
RESTORE FROM VALUES ADDITIVE
? STORED
SET DELETED OFF
SET DECIMALS TO 2
CLOSE INDEX
USE BASE ALIAS FIRST INDEX NAMES
DISPLAY OFF NAME RECORD 1
STOREX 9 TO STORED
STORX 10 TO STORED
STO 11 TO STORED
DISPX
SELECTOR 3
SETX TALK OFF
USEX
DOX NOTHING
APPEND BLANX
? STORED
USE
STORE 0 TO FLOWCNT
DO WHILE FLOWCNT<2
FLOWCNT=FLOWCNT+1
ENDDO
IF FLOWCNT=2
FLOWCNT=FLOWCNT+1
ENDIF
DO CASE
CASE .F.
FLOWCNT=99
OTHERWISE
FLOWCNT=FLOWCNT+1
ENDCASE
DO BUMP WITH 3
? FLOWCNT, STORED
?? "[DML-END]"
PROCEDURE BUMP
PARAMETERS AMOUNT
STORED=STORED+AMOUNT
RETURN
